meta {
  name: Club-Get-All
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

get {
  url: http://localhost:5000/clubs?type={{clubType}}&status={{clubStatus}}&search={{searchQuery}}&limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

vars:pre-request {
  clubType: "specialized"
  clubStatus: "active"
  searchQuery: "programming"
  limit: 20
  offset: 0
}

docs {
  # Get All Clubs API
  
  This endpoint retrieves all clubs in the system with optional filtering.
  
  ## Authentication
  - No authentication required
  
  ## Query Parameters
  - `type`: Filter by club type (optional)
    - Available types: general, specialized
  - `status`: Filter by club status (optional)
    - Available statuses: active, inactive
  - `search`: Search query to filter clubs by name or description (optional)
  - `limit`: Maximum number of results to return (optional, default: 20)
  - `offset`: Number of results to skip for pagination (optional, default: 0)
  - `fields`: Comma-separated list of club fields to include (optional)
  - `include`: Comma-separated list of related entities to include (optional)
    - Available relations: supervisor, memberCount
  
  ## Example
  ```
  GET /clubs?type=specialized&status=active&search=programming&limit=20&offset=0
  ```
  
  ## Response
  - `200 OK` on success with array of club data and pagination metadata:
    ```json
    {
      "data": [
        {
          "uuid": "club-uuid-1",
          "name": "Programming Club",
          "description": "A club for students interested in programming",
          "logo": "https://example.com/club-logo1.png",
          "type": "specialized",
          "status": "active",
          "memberCount": 45
        },
        {
          "uuid": "club-uuid-2",
          "name": "Web Programming Society",
          "description": "Learn web development and programming skills",
          "logo": "https://example.com/club-logo2.png",
          "type": "specialized",
          "status": "active",
          "memberCount": 32
        }
      ],
      "pagination": {
        "total": 5,
        "limit": 20,
        "offset": 0,
        "hasMore": false
      }
    }
    ```
  - `500 Internal Server Error` for server issues
}
